message: "If you use this software or its articles, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Evaluation Science Lab"
abstract: "How far can an AI evaluator be trusted? Reliability statistics beyond kappa, LLM-judge bias tests (position, verbosity, self-preference), sample sizes for judge validation and system comparison, drift monitoring with CUSUM, Goodhart effects, and a judge acceptance test in CI. No API key needed."
